  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: This shader is intended to be used on ponds or other small bodies of non-flowing
    water. It uses 3 Gerstner waves subgraphs to animated the vertices in a chaotic
    wave pattern. It also adds foam around the edges of the water where it intersects
    with other objects. The unique thing about the foam implementation in this shader
    is that it allows you to additionally paint a texture mask that determines where
    foam can be placed manually. This manual placed foam could be used for a spot
    where a waterfall is hitting the water - for example.
